  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small Modular Reactor Regulations and Civil Nuclear Energy Standards Workshop, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting a series of six (6) Small Modular Reactor (SMR) Regulations and Civil Nuclear Energy Standards Workshops to provide to support the U.S. SMR Public Private Partnership (PPP). The workshops will provide assistance to industry and government in developing effective regulatory frameworks, addressing challenges in the deployment of SMR technologies, and assisting U.S. companies to engage with opportunities in USTDA-eligible countries in Europe and Eurasia.</narrative>
  </description>
